        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'acel ma dwe mar'abirio wiripo bedo gi cokirok lamo. Wikiripi timo tic mewin; obedo ndelo ma kudho gwarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo cowirok ma mic awaŋa, maŋwe kur ri Rwoth. Rwath acel, wod rombo acel, kodi wot rombo abirio ma jongoye gi ŋolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic ma cemo ripo bedo moko m'onywow gi mo oliv. Kilo adek ma moko ri rwath, kilo ario ma moko ri wod rombo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi kilo acel ma moko ri kisi wot rombo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo bende wod diel ri mic ma cwako reco ma cwako reco mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miy win mic me medo i wi mic awaŋa ma dwe manyen kodi mic ma cemo mere, kanyacel gi mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo kodi mic ma cemo mere kodi mic ma vini, cungo kwoŋ kwer pajo. Jobedo mic awaŋa gi mac ma ŋwece kur mere sangala Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic i ndelo ma cwako reco",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
