            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'apar ma dwe mar'abirio wiripo bedo gi cokirok lamo. Wiripo riyo kec aka wikiripi timo tic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo Rwoth mic awaŋa ma ŋwece kur mere sangala go. Rwath acel, wod rombo acel, kodi wot rombo abirio ma jo oro acel ma jongoye gi ŋolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo gi mic ma cemo ma moko m'onuŋere m'onywow gi mo oliv. Moko kilo adek ri rwath, moko kilo ario ri wod rombo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi moko kilo acel ri kisi wot rombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo bende miyo wod diel ri mic ma cwako reco, medo i wi diel m'imiyo i kwer ma cwako reco pa ji, kanyacel gi mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo kodi mic ma cemo mere kodi mic ma vini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
