        },
        {
          "text": "K'apar g'abic ma dwe mar'abirio wiripo bedo gi cokirok ma lamo aka wikiripi timo tic. Wiripo timo kalima ri Rwoth ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo mic awaŋa gi mac maŋwe kur ri Rwoth. Rwath apar g'adek, wot rombo ario, wot rombo ma jo oro acel apar g'aŋwen ma jongoye gi ŋolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo gi mic ma cemo ma moko m'onuŋere m'onywow gi mo oliv. Moko kilo adek ri kisi rwath, kilo ario ri kisi wod rombo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
